+# TLS Backend
+
+This project's recorded decision is to use Rustls as the TLS backend: after initially selecting OpenSSL, the decision was changed to Rustls following a review comment, adopting a memory-safe, Rust-native TLS implementation in place of the OpenSSL-based approach.
